WpJmFsKuGJqRg8uJnNX67uu58s-MxU30YiQ&oe=69F0C3C7"}, {"file_name": "screen-3.png", "id": "1003454831259726", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75441584_1003454834593059_4414683215204598073_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vKBtOSGb5WgQ7kNvwF2moUR&_nc_oc=AdridG5FgGerb7JY2i3YO-oxctzVJ3er_6xE0B10oDqvrZNC2q9W90N4ngvscOZww2M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3E0VRr-UP17ClqkD2v3aVXh8CYwL40P95wGJ9r1osWOg&oe=69F0CF1E"}, {"file_name": "screen-4.png", "id": "1017662276733473", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75245822_1017662280066806_3140249560059418966_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=InZ_pdCNExcQ7kNvwEaCNOA&_nc_oc=AdosLbqSFIoJ-4e0C5NVPxxLxNfCJcY72Eb69fipzYsFfLbpTT0obT3WMyYR5HQhW2Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1eBzXS1gdnBii-QQ43G2lm5183Dxu6XUK2kblKCf2MRg&oe=69F09C8F"}, {"file_name": "screen-5.png", "id": "1132731301130632", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75375083_1132731304463965_2489209119133489696_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tx-I8MmKAYEQ7kNvwEjyamT&_nc_oc=AdobZIajqXoh8v5aXTpM6KeW7UxARtdJ6MIGcE_WMtbqqYRPlkRFYHBPP79CpVHN7TA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3uVkd3Gf62T7dX1GxGb8pRuUiDiObBcYkxzIj81Ckovg&oe=69F0AEC9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Mod2_Title.png", "id": "1212771323096726", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036673_1212771326430059_1176351761076307841_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t-VGLX5bFpEQ7kNvwHJPNlm&_nc_oc=AdoMcO2GmugJWrxMMj0liWG9xRJuEFXDmFzpgS2NmFc9L8skjeGbHfXOUrDjNiin4sY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3hzMk_dxZ5f7Sfu48Es_wKEhfsSol0cOfnJuZfVYPaBQ&oe=69F09F88"}, "display_name": "Hololab VR - NCSG Inspection Foundation Module 2: Masonry Wood Insert", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Hololab NCSG Module 02 Wood Burning Fireplace Inserts VR Application**\n\nThe Hololab National Chimney Sweep Guild VR application trains users in the critical skills needed to inspect and maintain wood-burning fireplace inserts to NCSG standards. The course features interactive slides, desktop activities, real-world simulations, and integrates with a Learning Management System. It challenges students with inspections of randomized issues in a virtual residential setting, ensuring they follow all necessary procedures.\n\n**VR Controls and PPE \u2013** Learn how to navigate the virtual environment while getting acquainted with essential personal protective equipment.\n\n**Responsibility & Worksite Hazard Assessment \u2013** Operate in a simulated environment to identify and mitigate hazards commonly encountered during inspections of wood-burning fireplace inserts.\n\n**Familiarization \u2013** Understand different types of wood-burning fireplace inserts and their common features.\n\n**Fireplace Insert Inspection \u2013** Utilize the official NCSG checklist to thoroughly inspect wood-burning fireplace inserts.\n\n**Real-World Simulation \u2013** Complete the inspection by correctly identifying issues with maximum safety awareness and forensic skills.\n\nData reports for review are saved and stored for engagement metrics and simulation performance analysis.\n\nAny off-platform monetization of content accessible in this app conforms to the Oculus Bulk IAP or Subscription Licenses app policy outlined here: https://developer.oculus.com/policy/app-policies", "short_description": "The Hololab National Chimney Sweep Guild Wood Burning Fireplace Inserts VR application equips users with the critical skills necessary to inspect and maintain wood-burning fireplace inserts according to NCSG standards. This in-depth course includes interactive slide content, desktop-based activities, realistic simulations, and comprehensive testing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ftfvr.com/privacy-app", "developer_terms_of_service